{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820390/extras/S_2_.png?t=1745011274\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Seclusion is a psychological horror game  inspired by the backrooms and liminal spaces.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Horror : </strong>You will question your surroundings, with unsettling visuals, unpredictable and surrealist environments, and a constant feeling of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival Horror : </strong>Adapt to your surroundings, avoid lurking dangers, and manage your resources carefully if you want to stay alive.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich lore : </strong>Find clues that slowly reveal the twisted history behind this world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820390/extras/S_5_.png?t=1745011274\" /><strong>Embark on a deeply personal journey through a world twisted by traumas, sorrow, guilt and fear.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Exploration : </strong>Navigate through eerie, atmospheric environments while solving puzzles that blocks your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evade &amp; Outsmart : </strong>Stay one step ahead of the <strong>Unique entities</strong> as you explore deeper into the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover the Mystery : </strong>Piece together the story as you move forward, revealing the dark secrets of this place.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820390/extras/storygif.gif?t=1745011274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820390/extras/S_4_.png?t=1745011274\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORER MODE AND MULTIPLAYER HAS BEEN DELAYED AND ISN'T YET AVAILABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team up with friends or venture alone in procedurally generated levels where every run brings new challenges and dangers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Worlds :\u00a0</strong>Each playthrough is different, offering fresh environments, puzzles, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Survival : </strong>Work together with up to 5 players to survive shifting environments and unpredictable threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic gameplay : </strong>Plan, Explore, and adapt as you encounter new obstacles and entities on every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In-game proximity voice chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember to wishlist and follow the game if you want to play it</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Together, we will find a way.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I am rich ! almost...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820390/a845c2dad09a43f7887e2bad9c6b6737923bf5c1.jpg"},{"name":"Bad eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820390/262f6d442be1a27224bb99b76ef68cc0419c4a90.jpg"},{"name":"Loud screamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820390/2f1055258cffc4c1acbf2dcdaef226c46be7f7ec.jpg"},{"name":"More space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820390/227ac601331874e812ab59a4bf4eddd2c450c53c.jpg"},{"name":"That must hur